  "keyFeatures": [
    "Automated claim registration with intelligent technical employee assignment",
    "Dual assignment strategies: least-loaded (Urgent) and most-experienced (Critical)",
    "Full claim lifecycle tracking with immutable audit history and transfer logs",
    "JWT-based stateless authentication with role-based access control (SALE_EMPLOYEE, TECHNICAL_EMPLOYEE, ADMIN, CLIENT)",
    "Claim transfer between technical employees with full traceability",
    "OpenAPI 3 / Swagger UI documentation at /swagger-ui/index.html",
    "Support for telecom products: TV, Internet, IP Telephony",
    "Soft-disable for users and employees without data loss"
  ],
